        "slc_f5b97795ca3e01efd267a25e6a82e0c69c16f2c483a32b8547b1062847c86077"
      ],
      "text": "The Refinery is a per-rig Bors-style merge queue: polecats run 'gt done' to create MR beads, the Refinery batches them, runs verification gates, and bisects failing batches; polecats never push directly to main."
    },
