      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_ccdfb00b460beb7a641ae585f2fcaca03ad271ab8b2c11d63b09b5e264b7f101"
      ],
      "text": "Bead/issue IDs use a prefix plus 5-character alphanumeric format (e.g. gt-abc12), where the prefix indicates the item's origin or rig; commands like gt sling and gt convoy accept these IDs."
    },
