      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_9d1b25596789515eb7bf3a88b56c87561f0a77fdce7ab08449798a07af0d084a"
      ],
      "text": "A stated key design principle is loose coupling: Gas Town orchestrates agents through tmux and environment variables, without importing or linking agent libraries — integration is configuration, not compilation."
    },
