      ],
      "text": "Agent provider integration is tiered: Tier 0 is zero-change tmux orchestration via send-keys and capture-pane, Tier 1 is a JSON preset in agents.json, Tier 2 adds hooks, and Tier 3 is deep native API integration."
    },
