        "slc_cd00761886f63cd5710f00bc32eea61596967633ebaea8e57b6d89e90a1d104c"
      ],
      "text": "Native installs require Git 2.20+, Go 1.26.2+ (per go.mod), Beads (bd) 0.57.0+, sqlite3, ICU4C dev headers for source builds, tmux 3.0+ for tmux-backed roles, and a Claude Code CLI as the default runtime; Docker installs only need Docker Compose."
